      "version": "",
      "Uid": null,
      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "Wolfgang.Etl.TestKit.ManualTimeSource",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Wolfgang.Etl.TestKit.ManualTimeSource.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">A controllable time source for tests: time stands still until <xref href=\"Wolfgang.Etl.TestKit.ManualTimeSource.Advance(System.TimeSpan)\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> is called,\nmaking a stage's <xref href=\"Wolfgang.Etl.Abstractions.Report\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> timing metrics — <xref href=\"Wolfgang.Etl.Abstractions.Report.Elapsed\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>,\n<xref href=\"Wolfgang.Etl.Abstractions.Report.ItemsPerSecond\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>, <xref href=\"Wolfgang.Etl.Abstractions.Report.PercentComplete\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>, and\n<xref href=\"Wolfgang.Etl.Abstractions.Report.EstimatedRemaining\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> — deterministic rather than wall-clock-dependent.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "ManagedReference",
      "source_relative_path": "api/Wolfgang.Etl.TestKit.RecordingMiddleware-1.yml",
      "output": {
        ".html": {
          "relative_path": "api/Wolfgang.Etl.TestKit.RecordingMiddleware-1.html"
        }
      },
      "version": "",
      "Uid": null,
      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "Wolfgang.Etl.TestKit.RecordingMiddleware<T>",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Wolfgang.Etl.TestKit.RecordingMiddleware-1.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">A test <xref href=\"Wolfgang.Etl.Abstractions.IItemMiddleware%601\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> that records every item passed through it and, by default,\nkeeps each item flowing. Supply a policy to transform or drop items, and inspect\n<xref href=\"Wolfgang.Etl.TestKit.RecordingMiddleware%601.Observed\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> to assert exactly what the middleware saw, in order.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "ManagedReference",
      "source_relative_path": "api/Wolfgang.Etl.TestKit.RetryingExtractor-1.yml",
      "output": {
        ".html": {
          "relative_path": "api/Wolfgang.Etl.TestKit.RetryingExtractor-1.html"
        }
      },
      "version": "",
      "Uid": null,
      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "Wolfgang.Etl.TestKit.RetryingExtractor<T>",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Wolfgang.Etl.TestKit.RetryingExtractor-1.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">An extractor double that throws a transient fault on its first <code>failFirstAttempts</code> worker\ninvocations and then succeeds, driven through a retry override of the\n<xref href=\"Wolfgang.Etl.Abstractions\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> 0.20 <code>WrapWorkerExecution</code> resilience seam. It both\ndemonstrates how to build stream-level retry on a stage and serves as the reference component\nexercised by <code>RetryContractTests</code> (in <code>Wolfgang.Etl.TestKit.Xunit</code>).</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "ManagedReference",
      "source_relative_path": "api/Wolfgang.Etl.TestKit.SnapshotTestLoader-1.yml",
      "output": {
        ".html": {
          "relative_path": "api/Wolfgang.Etl.TestKit.SnapshotTestLoader-1.html"
        }
      },
      "version": "",
      "Uid": null,
      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "Wolfgang.Etl.TestKit.SnapshotTestLoader<T>",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Wolfgang.Etl.TestKit.SnapshotTestLoader-1.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">An in-memory loader that captures every item it receives and renders them as a single,\ndeterministic, diff-friendly <xref href=\"Wolfgang.Etl.TestKit.SnapshotTestLoader%601.Snapshot\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> string — ready to hand to an approval /\nsnapshot-testing framework such as <a href=\"https://github.com/VerifyTests/Verify\">Verify</a>.</p>\n"
    },
